+**Formulas:**
+The optimization follows the vanilla 3DGS loss function [S1]:
+$$ \mathcal{L} = \mathcal{L}_{\text{L1}} + \lambda_{\text{ssim}} \mathcal{L}_{\text{ssim}} + \lambda_e \mathcal{L}_{\text{entropy}} $$
+Where:
+*   $\mathcal{L}_{\text{L1}}$ is the L1 loss between rendered and ground truth colors.
+*   $\mathcal{L}_{\text{ssim}}$ is the structural similarity index loss.
+*   $\mathcal{L}_{\text{entropy}}$ is an entropy regularization term.
+*   $\lambda_{\text{ssim}}$ and $\lambda_e$ are weighting hyperparameters [S1].
 
